        <dt>Allow bind 0.0.0.0:</dt>
        <dd>
          <select name="allow_bind_all">
            <?= mk_option($allow_all, 'no', 'No (recommended)') ?>
            <?= mk_option($allow_all, 'yes', 'Yes (dangerous)') ?>
          </select>
        </dd>
      </dl>
      <blockquote class="inline_help">
        Basic NBD has <strong>no authentication</strong>. Keep <strong>No</strong> and bind to a specific private IP
        (Thunderbolt or LAN). Only enable all-interfaces bind on a fully isolated network you control.
